The site's about

00:14:30.355 --> 00:14:32.275
100 feet here,

00:14:32.675 --> 00:14:33.715
but one of

00:14:34.115 --> 00:14:35.475
the concerns was

00:14:36.515 --> 00:14:40.675
within a couple 100 feet, we've got a stop sign at Merritt

