00:15:08.680 --> 00:15:09.640
I thought

00:15:10.440 --> 00:15:12.920
the common driveway wherever feasible

00:15:13.720 --> 00:15:14.760
was good.

00:15:17.000 --> 00:15:19.480
I asked for feedback

00:15:19.560 --> 00:15:21.160
