00:15:21.645 --> 00:15:24.365
a common driveway might not be feasible.

00:15:25.245 --> 00:15:26.685
And I was

00:15:27.565 --> 00:15:28.605
told that,

00:15:29.805 --> 00:15:31.645
you know, it's

00:15:31.645 --> 00:15:32.445
